      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Understood. I can do a full return for both orders, and route each refund to the **other order’s** payment method—but I’ll need a couple details first.\n\n1) Please provide the **two order IDs** (e.g., **#W0000001** and **#W0000002**).  \n2) Confirm you want to **return everything** in each of those two orders.  \n3) To avoid any mix-up, tell me which way you mean:\n   - Refund for **Order 1** → payment method of **Order 2**\n   - Refund for **Order 2** → payment method of **Order 1**\n   (Reply “yes” if that’s correct, or specify otherwise.)\n\nOnce you send the order IDs, I’ll check that both are **delivered** and then ask for your final **yes** to submit the returns.",
