      "content": "I’m not trying to make it hard—within our system I **must** have the **two order IDs** to (1) verify both are **delivered** and (2) see each order’s **payment method** so I can route the refunds exactly as you requested.\n\nPlease reply with:\n1) **Order ID #1** (format like **#W0000001**)  \n2) **Order ID #2** (format like **#W0000002**)  \n\nThen confirm this wording (just “confirmed” is fine):\n- Refund for **Order #1** → goes to **Order #2’s** payment method  \n- Refund for **Order #2** → goes to **Order #1’s** payment method  \n\nOnce I have the IDs, I’ll check both orders’ status and come back with the return details for a final **yes** to submit.",
